Q: Undefined reference to &#39;SDL_main&#39; A: <p>I was stuck in this issue for very long, I finally found the solution from the documentation.</p>
<p>Just define the macro the SDL_MAIN_USE_CALLBACKS macro before the other headers. SIMPLE.</p>
<pre class="lang-c prettyprint-override"><code>#define SDL_MAIN_USE_CALLBACKS 1
#include &lt;SDL3/SDL.h&gt;
#include &lt;SDL3/SDL_main.h&gt;
</code></pre>
<p>It will work normally then ;-)</p>
